WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.963
Welcome back to Building
Global Secure Access.

2
00:00:02.963 --> 00:00:07.249
This is Chapter 5: the compliant
network, and tenant restrictions.

3
00:00:07.249 --> 00:00:10.917
These are two settings only
Microsoft Entra can provide,

4
00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:13.725
and two of the easiest
ways to lock users out.

5
00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:17.250
The code's job is to say when
each is safe to enforce.

6
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:21.896
We'll start from Learn's example policy
and its universal tenant restrictions,

7
00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:23.397
see what they leave to you,

8
00:00:23.397 --> 00:00:27.400
read eleven checks and the plan's
enforcement gate, and walk two labs.

9
00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.914
The chapter is a draft awaiting review,

10
00:00:29.914 --> 00:00:33.500
and the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
